# 🚀 AI Resume Analyzer

An AI-powered recruiter dashboard that evaluates and ranks resumes based on job descriptions using NLP and machine learning.

## 🔥 Features
- 📄 Multi-resume analysis
- 🧠 Semantic similarity (BERT / MiniLM)
- 🎯 Skill matching & gap analysis
- 📊 Candidate ranking dashboard
- 📈 Interactive charts & KPIs
- 📥 Export results (CSV)

## 🛠️ Tech Stack
- Python
- Streamlit
- NLP (Sentence Transformers)
- Pandas, NumPy

## 🚀 How to Run
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app.py
```

